      "html": "<section id=\"section-aiad-intro\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative py-24 max-md:py-10 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-c2ba827a data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-prose flex-col gap-11 text-left\" data-v-c2ba827a><h2 class=\"font-normal tracking-tight max-md:text-3xl max-md:leading-9 text-4xl\" data-v-c2ba827a><span class=\"block text-spark\">What we do</span><span class=\"block text-slatecolor\">An AI agent development company for custom, connected agentic systems</span></h2><div class=\"body-content body-content--markdown flex flex-col text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor prose-body\" data-v-c2ba827a data-v-34ac1b0d><p>Fyntix is an AI agent development company based in Southwark, London. We design and build custom AI agents - agentic systems that connect to your tools, data and business logic so they can take action, not just generate a response.</p>\n<p>Most off-the-shelf AI assistants stop at answering questions. We build <strong>custom AI solutions</strong> that go further: agents that read from and write to your CRM, your internal APIs, your knowledge base and your workflows, with the permissions and guardrails an enterprise needs. That means real <strong>AI integration services</strong> work alongside the agent build itself - the agent is only as useful as the systems it's connected to.</p>\n<p>When the need is company-wide rather than a single agent, we deploy Agent Mesh: the connected agent framework you own, giving every employee a personal agent in Slack, grounded in shared company knowledge and portable across model providers.</p>\n<p>We work with scale-ups and global enterprises alike as an <strong>enterprise AI solutions</strong> partner - small senior squads, startup pace, enterprise-grade delivery, guardrails and observability built in from day one. Looking for automation or a broader AI software build too? See our <a href=\"/services/ai-agency\">AI agency services</a>. Want the same senior engineers embedded directly in your own team? See our <a href=\"/services/forward-deployed-engineers\">forward-deployed engineers</a>. Building a new product from scratch? See our <a href=\"/services/digital-product-agency\">digital product agency services</a>. Still comparing providers? We mapped the market in <a href=\"/feed/top-ai-agent-development-companies-in-the-uk-2026\">top AI agent development companies in the UK</a>, and set out the questions worth asking in <a href=\"/feed/how-to-choose-an-ai-agent-development-company\">how to choose an AI agent development company</a>.</p>\n</div></div></section>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "class": "view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human"
      },
      "html": "<div class=\"w-full overflow-hidden bg-chalk\"><section id=\"section-aiad-pillars\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative gap-40 pt-40 pb-20 max-md:pt-20 max-md:pb-10 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-1c6297c3><h2 class=\"font-normal text-5xl\"><span class=\"text-spark\">Custom agent development, integrated end to end</span><br><span class=\"text-slatecolor\">What AI agent development delivers - agents designed around your business logic, connected to your real systems, and run with enterprise-grade guardrails.</span></h2><div class=\"grid-cols-3 grid w-full max-md:grid-cols-1 items-stretch max-md:gap-16 gap-24\"><div class=\"flex h-full w-full flex-col items-start max-md:gap-6 gap-8\"><div class=\"relative max-md:size-80 size-72 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"pillar-particle-field pointer-events-auto relative h-full w-full overflow-hidden cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing touch-none\"><span></span></div></div><div class=\"flex w-full flex-1 flex-col items-start gap-16\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-1 flex-col items-start max-md:gap-10 gap-8\"><h3 class=\"text-spark font-normal text-5xl\">Agentic AI design</h3><p class=\"text-slatecolor text-3xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\">Agents built around your logic.</p><p class=\"text-haze-800 max-md:text-2xl max-md:leading-8 text-xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\">We design custom AI agents around your specific business logic and decision-making - not a generic chatbot wrapper. Every agent is scoped to the tasks it should actually own.</p><div class=\"flex w-full items-center gap-4\"><img src=\"/content-media/clients/sage-logo-evidence.gen.webp\" alt=\"Sage\" class=\"size-12 shrink-0 object-contain\" loading=\"lazy\"><p class=\"text-slatecolor text-lg font-normal leading-normal tracking-tight\">We defined &amp; piloted a creative intelligence agent with Sage to drive ads ROI.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"flex h-full w-full flex-col items-start max-md:gap-6 gap-8\"><div class=\"relative max-md:size-80 size-72 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"pillar-particle-field pointer-events-auto relative h-full w-full overflow-hidden cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing touch-none\"><span></span></div></div><div class=\"flex w-full flex-1 flex-col items-start gap-16\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-1 flex-col items-start max-md:gap-10 gap-8\"><h3 class=\"text-spark font-normal text-5xl\">AI integration services</h3><p class=\"text-slatecolor text-3xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\">Connected to your real systems.</p><p class=\"text-haze-800 max-md:text-2xl max-md:leading-8 text-xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\">Custom AI solutions connected to your CRM, internal APIs, data warehouse and existing tools - so agents can retrieve real context and act, with proper authentication and access control.</p><div class=\"flex w-full items-center gap-4\"><img src=\"/_nuxt/google-cloud-evidence._xZJoMAR.svg\" alt=\"Google Cloud\" class=\"size-12 shrink-0 object-contain\" loading=\"lazy\"><p class=\"text-slatecolor text-lg font-normal leading-normal tracking-tight\">We uncovered sales opportunities for 5,000 Googlers with an agentic sales system.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"flex h-full w-full flex-col items-start max-md:gap-6 gap-8\"><div class=\"relative max-md:size-80 size-72 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"pillar-particle-field pointer-events-auto relative h-full w-full overflow-hidden cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing touch-none\"><span></span></div></div><div class=\"flex w-full flex-1 flex-col items-start gap-16\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-1 flex-col items-start max-md:gap-10 gap-8\"><h3 class=\"text-spark font-normal text-5xl\">Enterprise AI solutions</h3><p class=\"text-slatecolor text-3xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\">Guardrails, from day one.</p><p class=\"text-haze-800 max-md:text-2xl max-md:leading-8 text-xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\">Permissions, business-logic guardrails, and observability built into every agent system we ship - so agentic AI is safe to run at enterprise scale, not just in a demo.</p><div class=\"flex w-full items-center gap-4\"><img src=\"/content-media/clients/tesco-logo.gen.webp\" alt=\"Tesco\" class=\"size-12 shrink-0 object-contain\" loading=\"lazy\"><p class=\"text-slatecolor text-lg font-normal leading-normal tracking-tight\">We built an AI-native creative studio that took Tesco's retail ads from four-week approvals to days.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section></div>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "attributes": {
