        "data-v-be4afccd": ""
      },
      "html": "<div class=\"w-full bg-chalk\" data-v-be4afccd><section id=\"section-aiad-faq\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative py-32 max-md:py-12 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-be4afccd data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-12\" data-v-be4afccd><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6\" data-v-be4afccd><h2 class=\"font-normal text-5xl\" data-v-be4afccd><span class=\"text-spark\">AI agent development FAQs</span></h2><p class=\"max-w-3xl text-xl leading-snug tracking-tight text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd>Straight answers for teams evaluating an AI agent development company.</p></div><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col\" data-v-be4afccd><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>What is AI agent development? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>AI agent development is the process of designing, building and deploying AI agents - systems that can reason about a task and take action, not just generate a response. That includes defining the agent's business logic, connecting it to real tools and data, and adding the permissions and guardrails needed to run it safely.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>What is the difference between an AI agent and a chatbot? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>A chatbot answers questions. An AI agent acts - it can read from and write to your systems, chain together multiple steps, and complete a task on your behalf within defined guardrails. Most of what we build sits closer to the agent end: connected to real tools, not just a conversation window.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>Do you offer custom AI solutions or off-the-shelf agents? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>Custom. Off-the-shelf AI assistants are built for the general case; we design agents around your specific business logic, data, and workflows, so the agent actually fits how your team works rather than the other way round.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>What does AI integration services work involve? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>Connecting an agent to your existing systems - CRM, internal APIs, data warehouse, knowledge base, and tools like Slack - with proper authentication, permissions, and access control, so the agent has real context to act on rather than working from a static prompt.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>Is agentic AI safe to run at enterprise scale? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>It can be, with the right guardrails: scoped permissions, business-logic constraints, human-in-the-loop checkpoints where needed, and observability so you can see what an agent did and why. We build these in from day one rather than bolting them on after a proof of concept.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>How is Fyntix different from other AI agent development companies? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>We combine agent design, systems integration, and enterprise-grade guardrails in one embedded squad, backed by delivery experience spanning scale-ups and enterprises: Google, Tesco, Sage, Revolut, and YourAvatar. Small senior teams, startup pace, production quality.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>Do you work with scale-ups as well as enterprises? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>Yes. We work with ambitious scale-ups and global enterprises - from YourAvatar and Upstix to Google and Tesco. The engagement model adapts to your stage: discovery sprints and proofs of concept for early bets, embedded squads for full agent builds and integration.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>Can your engineers work inside our team? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>Yes. We hire and manage them, and they work embedded with your people.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>Where is your AI agent development company based? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>Our HQ is in Southwark, London - The Binary, 27 Copperfield Street, SE1 0EN. We work with clients across the UK and internationally, from scale-ups to global enterprises.</span></div></details></div></div></section></div>"
    },
